{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0408D0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"你父亲的事……很遗憾。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"没办法。这就是游击战士的宿命。我们把命献给国家和人民……我也已经做好觉悟了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":114,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"我看未必。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"当然了！“祖国或死亡”……这是老爸的口头禅。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"格瓦拉吗。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"老爸跟我讲过很多故事。桑地诺将军的事迹、和国民警卫队Guardia的战斗……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":103,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"还有离家出走的妈妈。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"你没跟母亲一起走吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"说什么呢。我选择了革命，而不是妈妈。就这么回事。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"但你还是想见她吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"我不知道。不过，等我们完成革命以后，一定能见到她。不知道为什么，我就是有这种感觉。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":123,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"到时候就能和<R=父亲,MI VIEJO>、妈妈一起，大家重新生活在一起。我本来一直这么想……。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=父亲,MI VIEJO>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":118,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"<R=父亲,MI VIEJO>……。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=父亲,MI VIEJO>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":28,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"振作点，Chico。你不是要保护姐姐吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":50,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"嗯……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""}]}